            "review_title": "Review at La petite Maison",
            "review_text": "Thao D\nCape Town, South Africa335 contributions\n0\ndelightful place to have coffee in Danang (hidding away from the crowd))\nMar 2016 • Family\nThis place locates at the end of Le Loi street, is owned by nice couple. The coffee shop's style quite elegant. At the time I were going there, they have the cinema room playing little movies. Nice idea but they still need to work on that a lot.\nThe bake and coffee there are great. The waitress could speak Eng, helpful to the customer. My teething problem is there was many mosquitoes inside the coffee shop.\nTheir 2nd floor could be reserved for the party or meeting. Great white stair's a big impression. Nice atmosphere overall.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 4, 2017",
            "rating": 5.0,
