            "review_text": "Michebh\nMelbourne, Australia69 contributions\n0\nIncredible dining experience\nJan 2013 • Friends\nLa Maison at the Intercontinental Danang Vietnam has only been open a short time, but the food is outstanding and the ambience in wonderfully relaxed. I had the rabbit fillets, so delicate and the presentation was world standard. \nIt was an unexpected delight.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 19, 2013",
